+        },
+        {
+          "block": "P098",
+          "line": 98,
+          "text": "When we interviewed all of the individuals involved with the CIR, they asserted that they recalled nothing about it. Dwight told the OIG that he did not recall being aware of the information about Mihdhar, did not recall drafting the CIR, did not recall whether he drafted the CIR on his own initiative or at the direction of his supervisor, and did not recall any discussions about the reasons for delaying completion and dissemination of the CIR. Malcolm said he did not recall reviewing any of the cable traffic or any information regarding Hazmi and Mihdhar. Eric told the OIG that he did not recall the CIR.",
+          "status": "Previously extracted source passage retained; this intake does not newly resolve historical truth",
+          "source_url": "https://oig.justice.gov/sites/default/files/archive/special/0506/chapter5.htm",
