+      "exact_original_request_wording": "1. PRIORITY NEXT: CIA information hold, claimed FBI notification, and late oversight disclosure.\nTrace the original Mihdhar intelligence report/draft, the instruction holding dissemination, routing/access logs, the cable stating the information had reached the FBI, and the later oversight-production record. Identify who made each decision, when, and the records supporting each account. Treat the pre-attack dissemination failure and the draft’s late discovery as separate propositions; test their connection rather than assume it. Preserve the conflicting accounts and the OIG’s inability to corroborate notification.\nStarting source: https://oig.justice.gov/sites/default/files/archive/special/0506/chapter5.htm",
