+      "exact_original_request_wording": "2. FBI informant handling and payment.\nSeek original handler reports, source evaluations, the $100,000 payment authorization/disbursement, and source-closure decision. Determine what the payment compensated and what information the source supplied. The OIG’s payment/closure account does not itself establish the payment’s purpose. Include contrary findings and the inconclusive-polygraph context.\nStarting source: the DOJ OIG chapter above, especially footnotes 130–135.",
