+          "exact_original_wording": "| **The FBI-informant landlord proves government direction** | **A real and troubling relationship; direction is not established.** Hazmi and Mihdhar lived with an FBI asset. The Inspector General recorded inconsistent accounts, weak documentation, and missed opportunities, and could not directly interview the asset or retired handler. That supports serious scrutiny, not a demonstrated conclusion that the FBI controlled the hijackers. [oig.justice.gov](https://oig.justice.gov/sites/default/files/archive/special/0506/chapter5.htm?utm_source=chatgpt.com) |",
